SimulationType                MonteCarlo
NumberOfCycles                500000
NumberOfInitializationCycles  50000
PrintEvery                    5000

Forcefield                    local
ChargeMethod                  Ewald
EwaldPrecision                1e-6
CutOffVDW                     12.8
CutOffCoulomb                 12.8
RemoveAtomNumberCodeFromLabel yes

WidomProbability              1.0

Framework 0
